{"script":"yd_011_06","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":160,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-206,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":160,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-206,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]嘿嘿嘿……{myName}无聊吗？缇莎可以和你说哦，关于妈妈的小秘密～[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]妈妈她呀，很在意别人说她的身高哦！而且她睡觉的时候还会磨牙，打呼噜声音也超级大！[r]有一次，她以为周围没人的时候，竟然追着一只蜻蜓跑了好久，都被缇莎看到啦！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]很意外吧～那个明明有着很强大的力量的妈妈，居然也有这些小秘密。[r]嘿嘿，不过可别和妈妈说是缇莎告的密哦，缇莎肯定会挨骂的～[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]不过……虽然缇莎经常挨妈妈的骂，但缇莎知道妈妈是爱缇莎的。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]缇莎也超喜欢妈妈哦！这也是缇莎的小秘密！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":160,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-206,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},